<title>USA: MetroBanCorp sets qtly div $0.05.</title>
<headline>MetroBanCorp sets qtly div $0.05.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>MetroBanCorp said it declared a quarterly dividend of $0.05 per share to be paid March 24, to shareholders of record on February 28.</p>
<p>The company said it would begin paying a quarterly dividend in 1997.  The prior dividend was a semi-annual dividend of $0.10 per share.</p>
